      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Compound 1 shows weak antiferromagnetic Gd···Gd coupling (J = −0.24 cm−1, g = 1.98) and cryogenic magnetocaloric behavior with −ΔSm = 30.20 J K−1 kg−1 for ΔH = 7 T at 2.0 K. Magnetization saturates at 28.00 Nβ at 80 kOe and 2 K.",
